WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.561
Choose comparative and superlative forms accurately when describing two or more

00:00:04.561 --> 00:00:04.957
things.

00:00:05.783 --> 00:00:08.962
Choose the superlative of small. Answer: smallest

00:00:09.783 --> 00:00:15.223
Write a comparative description using good/better/best and two regular adjectives.

00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:18.465
Why it works: Smallest compares three or more.
